  "details": "After selecting 'ghost' or 'solid' the camera lens remains invisible. It only appears after you also either anchor the camera or enter drone mode and then vanishes again after unpinning or exiting drone.\nIf you cycle to a different pin, button highlighting doesn't properly update. If you change the lens visibility after cycling pins that change will effect the original pin.  As in, if pin 1 has the lens visibility set to solid and you select pin 2 and change it to display ghost lens, pin 1 will also change to ghost",
